Zugg is a wizard and a friend of [[People/Althane/The Broker|the Broker]], who helped raise the citadel of [[Geography/Elysium|Elysium]]. He is powerful, very clever and paranoid, and the Broker keeps him as a method of last resort: the last time Zugg was brought into a recovery, close to a hundred thousand clones of him broke away, founded a country of their own and took the greater part of the continent they stood on. He is away raising a second citadel of his own.
